                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fbbc1dcd-26cc-3682-8e7d-a0c7ee052ecc",
                        "entry_id": "015cd25a-6fca-3414-ad75-8cf75a58fd0b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To speak foolishly, pompously, or at length; to blather."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c71d5f77-55af-4623-a082-06be503755fa",
                                "sense_id": "fbbc1dcd-26cc-3682-8e7d-a0c7ee052ecc",
                                "text": "\"You're a swell at it. I'll allow that. And I'll provide the gas-bagging.\" / \"The gas-bagging?\" I inquired. \"What exactly do you mean?\" / \"What do I mean, you dear old sober-sides?\" said Lyne. “I mean that I will do all the bow-wowing[…]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1f89d17-c361-4b9d-9272-a04332002313",
                                "sense_id": "fbbc1dcd-26cc-3682-8e7d-a0c7ee052ecc",
                                "text": "You all see her flirtin and makin up to people and then they gasbag about it to make themselves important. But that's just her way. Underneath she's one of the most shy people you'd ever meet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54685ba2-f7c9-4b27-90e5-4cdcf8fdc98a",
                                "sense_id": "fbbc1dcd-26cc-3682-8e7d-a0c7ee052ecc",
                                "text": "I'm pushing the trolley down an aisle in which there are a dozen ladies gasbagging."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "181299bb-d282-4c1f-b242-73e44aac2555",
                                "sense_id": "fbbc1dcd-26cc-3682-8e7d-a0c7ee052ecc",
                                "text": "Morning, noon, and night they gasbagged about every aspect of the operation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9cfa36c-c13b-4c68-9a73-cca5d811bb39",
                                "sense_id": "fbbc1dcd-26cc-3682-8e7d-a0c7ee052ecc",
                                "text": "[…] Kingi spotted them and strode over. 'What are you two gasbagging about? Come on, join the party.' / 'We're not gasbagging, we're strategising,' Josie pointed out."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
